1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,580
Welcome to the unit.

2
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:08,430
Emergency or natural disaster? B.

3
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:14,420
Sandy and Millie are talking about emergencies and natural disasters.

4
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:23,190
Work in pairs and talk about an emergency or a natural disaster you have heard about or experienced.

5
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:26,870
Use the conversation below as a model.

6
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:36,300
Did you hear about the fog disaster in Star Town last week? No. What happened?

7
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:45,650
The fog was so thick that drivers couldn't see more than a meter in front of them. Oh really? Yes.

8
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:48,450
Many cars hit each other.

9
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:54,050
It was one of the largest traffic accidents in the town's history.

10
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:56,950
Was anyone hurt? Yes.

11
00:00:56,950 --> 00:01:03,640
12 people died and over 40 were hurt in the accident. That's terrible!
